  "title": "Human Interest Earns Fortune Best Place to Work in the Bay Area 2024 and Great Place To Work Certification™",
  "summary": "Human Interest announced today that it earned a spot on Fortune Best Place to Work in the Bay Area 2024 and was Certified™ as a Great Place To Work® for the second year in a row. Since 2020, Human Interest has received multiple workplace awards, including recognition from Forbes, Built In, Glassdoor, SF Business Times, and Inc. – all a testament to its powerful and positive workplace culture.",
